Guess I'm pretty useful then.

839
00:35:53,133 --> 00:35:54,400
I wrote something really touching.

840
00:35:54,433 --> 00:35:55,966
If someone wrote that to me,

841
00:35:56,000 --> 00:35:56,933
I'd be moved.

842
00:36:15,300 --> 00:36:16,533
Tao's heading out.

843
00:36:16,533 --> 00:36:17,333
Tao!

844
00:36:17,333 --> 00:36:18,833
Tao!

845
00:36:18,866 --> 00:36:20,200
You got this!

846
00:36:20,233 --> 00:36:20,533
Tao!

847
00:36:20,533 --> 00:36:22,466
He looks like he's going into battle.

848
00:36:33,600 --> 00:36:35,266
Dear Autumn,

849
00:36:35,266 --> 00:36:37,700
Guo Zhentao has sent you
a confession invite.

850
00:36:38,400 --> 00:36:40,666
[Guo Zhentao invited Autumn.]

851
00:36:40,933 --> 00:36:42,433
Follow your heart,

852
00:36:42,466 --> 00:36:44,400
decide if you want to go meet him

853
00:36:44,433 --> 00:36:46,233
at the Moon of Affection.

854
00:36:54,200 --> 00:36:56,466
[Autumn didn't make her choice.]

855
00:37:09,633 --> 00:37:11,433
Hello.

856
00:37:12,600 --> 00:37:13,533
Hi.

857
00:37:14,433 --> 00:37:15,833
What are you holding?

858
00:37:16,533 --> 00:37:17,733
[Moonstone Box]
Got your pancake.

859
00:37:19,300 --> 00:37:21,500
Your big promise.

860
00:37:21,500 --> 00:37:22,733
My phone...

861
00:37:22,733 --> 00:37:24,133
Can you drop it in your pocket?

862
00:37:24,133 --> 00:37:25,733
Here, put it here.

863
00:37:27,500 --> 00:37:28,633
And this too?

864
00:37:28,666 --> 00:37:29,100
Okay.

865
00:37:29,100 --> 00:37:29,633
Good?

866
00:37:29,666 --> 00:37:30,066
Yeah.

867
00:37:30,066 --> 00:37:31,533
Don't tell me you wrote a letter too.

868
00:37:31,900 --> 00:37:32,433
I didn't.

869
00:37:33,600 --> 00:37:34,666
[No Moonstone]
But I didn't bring that.

870
00:37:35,600 --> 00:37:36,466
Really?

871
00:37:36,466 --> 00:37:37,000
Alright.

872
00:37:38,300 --> 00:37:39,133
It's only been, like, ten days.

873
00:37:39,133 --> 00:37:40,766
For both of us,

874
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:42,333
[Still Unsure]
it still feels a bit fast.

875
00:37:42,333 --> 00:37:44,033
If I showed up with a Moonstone,

876
00:37:44,066 --> 00:37:46,300
she'd feel the pressure instantly.

877
00:37:46,300 --> 00:37:48,366
[This Morning]
You're not confessing tonight?

878
00:37:48,400 --> 00:37:49,866
That's a lot of pressure.

879
00:37:49,866 --> 00:37:51,166
And it'd stress her out too.

880
00:37:51,200 --> 00:37:52,266
[Worried about Pressuring Autumn]
Feels unnecessary.

881
00:37:52,266 --> 00:37:53,066
Forget it.

882
00:37:53,433 --> 00:37:54,900
[Before the Confession Choice]
Have you made up your mind?

883
00:37:54,900 --> 00:37:56,133
I can't decide.

884
00:37:56,133 --> 00:37:57,966
You don't have to confess.

885
00:37:58,000 --> 00:37:58,700
You can just talk to her.

886
00:37:58,700 --> 00:37:59,766
So?

887
00:38:00,100 --> 00:38:01,400
Just talking, then.

888
00:38:01,433 --> 00:38:01,966
Talking?

889
00:38:02,000 --> 00:38:03,066
Yeah, just talking.

890
00:38:03,066 --> 00:38:04,566
I'm really slow to warm up.

891
00:38:04,600 --> 00:38:05,200
Living on the island

892
00:38:05,200 --> 00:38:07,233
sped things up,

893
00:38:07,233 --> 00:38:08,100
but I still think

894
00:38:08,100 --> 00:38:09,800
we need more time to know each other.

895
00:38:09,833 --> 00:38:11,366
That's being responsible for both of us.

896
00:38:20,933 --> 00:38:23,433
[Put the Letter in the Box]

897
00:38:23,633 --> 00:38:25,933
[Left the Moonstone Behind]

898
00:38:26,333 --> 00:38:27,833
[Autumn
also left hers behind.]

899
00:38:27,866 --> 00:38:28,866
You should never

900
00:38:28,866 --> 00:38:30,100
rush a relationship.

901
00:38:30,100 --> 00:38:31,433
We actually haven't

902
00:38:31,466 --> 00:38:32,866
spent that much time together.

903
00:38:32,866 --> 00:38:35,466
Showing up with a Moonstone

904
00:38:35,466 --> 00:38:38,266
would just overwhelm us both.

905
00:38:38,266 --> 00:38:40,500
So we both feel

906
00:38:40,500 --> 00:38:41,933
keeping it light

907
00:38:41,933 --> 00:38:43,433
is the better move.

908
00:38:44,066 --> 00:38:45,800
Alright, let me start.

909
00:38:46,266 --> 00:38:47,166
Go ahead.

910
00:38:47,200 --> 00:38:48,266
Hope I don't make you cry.

911
00:38:52,933 --> 00:38:53,566
Qiuqiu.

912
00:38:54,866 --> 00:38:55,900
First time calling you that,

913
00:38:55,900 --> 00:38:57,933
sweet, but also kinda weird.

914
00:38:59,633 --> 00:39:01,566
It probably

915
00:39:01,600 --> 00:39:02,300
means

916
00:39:02,300 --> 00:39:03,633
I'm really starting to like you.

917
00:39:07,466 --> 00:39:09,366
First, let me be clear,

918
00:39:09,400 --> 00:39:10,933
this isn't a confession.

919
00:39:10,933 --> 00:39:12,866
I just want to share

920
00:39:12,900 --> 00:39:15,033
how I feel right now.

921
00:39:15,066 --> 00:39:16,266
So,

922
00:39:16,266 --> 00:39:18,300
don't feel pressured.

923
00:39:19,833 --> 00:39:21,733
First, a quick look back at

924
00:39:21,733 --> 00:39:23,966
these past few days for me.

925
00:39:24,000 --> 00:39:27,033
The first time
I felt something was day two,

926
00:39:27,033 --> 00:39:29,033
when you kept calling my name nonstop.

927
00:39:29,800 --> 00:39:30,333
Sorry.

928
00:39:30,333 --> 00:39:32,766
I'll write your name a hundred times.

929
00:39:32,800 --> 00:39:34,333
Write it in the sand.

930
00:39:34,333 --> 00:39:34,800
Okay.

931
00:39:35,466 --> 00:39:37,600
I thought, she's interesting,

932
00:39:38,066 --> 00:39:39,133
a little confusing,

933
00:39:39,133 --> 00:39:40,133
and goofy.

934
00:39:42,100 --> 00:39:45,000
The second time was our day-three date.

935
00:39:45,033 --> 00:39:46,633
When we were taking photos,

936
00:39:46,633 --> 00:39:48,933
you suddenly started dancing,

937
00:39:48,933 --> 00:39:50,666
and once again I couldn't look away.

938
00:39:52,733 --> 00:39:53,400
From then on,

939
00:39:53,433 --> 00:39:56,033
our dynamic kinda became:

940
00:39:56,033 --> 00:39:57,766
you roasting me,
and me loving every second of it.

941
00:39:57,833 --> 00:40:03,133
[You roasting me,
and me loving every second of it.]

942
00:40:03,466 --> 00:40:05,066
You're the type who skips breakfast?

943
00:40:05,066 --> 00:40:05,800
The opposite.

944
00:40:05,833 --> 00:40:06,566
Oh, right!

945
00:40:06,600 --> 00:40:07,133
Unbelievable.

946
00:40:07,133 --> 00:40:08,166
Man, you're something else.

947
00:40:08,200 --> 00:40:09,466
He can eat breakfast.

948
00:40:09,466 --> 00:40:10,100
Got it.

949
00:40:10,100 --> 00:40:10,766
Impressive!

950
00:40:10,800 --> 00:40:12,533
Well, I'll remember him,

951
00:40:12,533 --> 00:40:13,233
a man who made me

952
00:40:13,266 --> 00:40:15,733
split the bill on our first meal.

953
00:40:15,733 --> 00:40:16,666
Total turn-off!

954
00:40:16,700 --> 00:40:18,100
So you're into girl groups?

955
00:40:18,100 --> 00:40:18,933
Pretty cool, right?

956
00:40:18,933 --> 00:40:20,833
Who knew, Tao.

957
00:40:20,866 --> 00:40:21,900
I'm starting to think

958
00:40:21,900 --> 00:40:24,000
you are Eddie Peng.

959
00:40:24,033 --> 00:40:25,666
I had the makeup artist do me like him.

960
00:40:25,666 --> 00:40:27,200
Tough job, thanks for trying.

961
00:40:30,133 --> 00:40:31,933
The most recent spark

962
00:40:31,933 --> 00:40:34,366
was probably
our off-island date yesterday.

963
00:40:35,433 --> 00:40:37,366
I saw your childish side,

964
00:40:39,400 --> 00:40:40,900
your cute side,

965
00:40:40,900 --> 00:40:42,200
and your sincere side.

966
00:40:43,633 --> 00:40:45,666
I'll remember

967
00:40:45,666 --> 00:40:47,466
all these little moments.

968
00:40:47,466 --> 00:40:49,733
I'll stop the reminiscing there.

969
00:40:50,900 --> 00:40:52,600
Last thing I want to say,

970
00:40:52,633 --> 00:40:54,233
today's our last day

971
00:40:54,233 --> 00:40:55,433
on this island,

972
00:40:55,433 --> 00:40:58,666
but I hope it's the start
of something new.

973
00:40:58,666 --> 00:41:00,366
We've got a long road ahead.

974
00:41:00,400 --> 00:41:01,866
We've got a long road ahead.

975
00:41:09,500 --> 00:41:12,600
So why didn't I bring the Moonstone?

976
00:41:12,633 --> 00:41:15,466
Because that means being together.

977
00:41:16,700 --> 00:41:19,833
I thought you might need

978
00:41:19,866 --> 00:41:21,333
a little more time.

979
00:41:21,333 --> 00:41:24,266
I don't want to put
too much pressure on you.

980
00:41:24,300 --> 00:41:26,233
So I didn't bring it.

981
00:41:26,266 --> 00:41:28,133
Maybe we still need a little more time
to get to know each other.

982
00:41:30,833 --> 00:41:32,266
It really touched my heart

983
00:41:32,266 --> 00:41:34,100
to know he wrote me a letter.

984
00:41:34,100 --> 00:41:37,100
His way with words also makes me feel

985
00:41:37,100 --> 00:41:39,366
he's very, very thoughtful.

986
00:41:39,400 --> 00:41:39,833
Tao (Guo Zhentao)

987
00:41:39,833 --> 00:41:41,633
didn't bring his Moonstone.

988
00:41:41,633 --> 00:41:43,100
Most likely,

989
00:41:43,100 --> 00:41:44,133
when it comes to feelings,

990
00:41:44,133 --> 00:41:45,666
you need to take your time.

991
00:41:46,400 --> 00:41:48,133
You're too considerate.

992
00:41:50,466 --> 00:41:53,366
Should I show you what I wrote?

993
00:41:54,900 --> 00:41:56,833
But actually, I wanted you to read it.

994
00:41:57,733 --> 00:41:58,333
You should've said so earlier.

995
00:41:58,333 --> 00:41:59,400
We could've swapped and read each other's.

996
00:42:01,433 --> 00:42:02,233
Dear Tao (Guo Zhentao),

997
00:42:02,233 --> 00:42:03,233
it's a pleasure to meet you.

998
00:42:03,233 --> 00:42:05,733
I wanted to tell you in person,

999
00:42:05,733 --> 00:42:07,200
but seeing you unable

1000
00:42:07,233 --> 00:42:08,766
to control your emotions

1001
00:42:08,800 --> 00:42:10,400
when facing written words this afternoon,

1002
00:42:11,866 --> 00:42:13,800
I had a mischievous idea again.

1003
00:42:13,833 --> 00:42:15,466
I have to challenge your tear ducts.

1004
00:42:15,466 --> 00:42:16,700
I can't believe you.

1005
00:42:17,733 --> 00:42:19,433
Let's see if I can summon

1006
00:42:19,466 --> 00:42:20,500
the "whimper" inside that tough,

1007
00:42:20,500 --> 00:42:22,100
tanned guy's shell again.

1008
00:42:22,100 --> 00:42:23,800
Love is a product of time and space.

1009
00:42:23,833 --> 00:42:26,133
It's especially evident on this island.

1010
00:42:27,100 --> 00:42:29,166
Perhaps it was that afternoon
when I felt guilty

1011
00:42:29,200 --> 00:42:31,633
for not remembering your name
and kept repeating it.

1012
00:42:32,633 --> 00:42:34,366
Perhaps it was that evening
when I was casually eating and chatting,

1013
00:42:34,400 --> 00:42:36,266
wearing the "077" jersey

1014
00:42:36,266 --> 00:42:37,500
without thinking.

1015
00:42:37,500 --> 00:42:39,166
It made you notice me
on this little island

1016
00:42:39,200 --> 00:42:40,466
with no communication devices (internet),

1017
00:42:40,466 --> 00:42:41,933
unaware of any external factors.

1018
00:42:41,933 --> 00:42:43,533
So, in the time that followed,

1019
00:42:43,533 --> 00:42:45,333
on that dusk when I was fast asleep,

1020
00:42:45,333 --> 00:42:47,600
you sent me an invitation to a meal.

1021
00:42:48,000 --> 00:42:49,133
On that cold, rainy day,

1022
00:42:49,133 --> 00:42:50,733
you brought me medicine.

1023
00:42:50,733 --> 00:42:52,966
On another noon when I was sleeping,

1024
00:42:53,000 --> 00:42:54,500
you packed lunch for me,

1025
00:42:54,500 --> 00:42:56,100
providing a delivery service.

1026
00:42:57,233 --> 00:42:58,566
I've noticed all these acts of care.

1027
00:42:58,600 --> 00:42:59,666
Thank you.

1028
00:42:59,666 --> 00:43:00,500
Through these actions,

1029
00:43:00,500 --> 00:43:03,000
I've sensed that you're a thoughtful guy.

1030
00:43:03,033 --> 00:43:05,333
Maybe you are not the best with words,

1031
00:43:05,333 --> 00:43:06,766
but you are warm through your deeds.

1032
00:43:06,800 --> 00:43:09,533
These warm moments piled up,

1033
00:43:09,533 --> 00:43:11,433
making me feel that you're a good person.

1034
00:43:11,833 --> 00:43:13,433
Okay, a good person.

1035
00:43:13,433 --> 00:43:14,300
I mean it.

1036
00:43:15,033 --> 00:43:16,466
But what truly moved me

1037
00:43:16,466 --> 00:43:18,366
was that sentence you said yesterday

1038
00:43:18,400 --> 00:43:19,933
when we were playing off the island,
chatting casually.

1039
00:43:21,666 --> 00:43:22,333
Sometimes,

1040
00:43:22,333 --> 00:43:24,466
when friends asked you out
for drinks or something...

1041
00:43:24,500 --> 00:43:25,600
If someone really invited me,

1042
00:43:25,633 --> 00:43:26,733
there would inevitably be girls.

1043
00:43:26,733 --> 00:43:28,833
Then you go with your girlfriend.

1044
00:43:28,866 --> 00:43:29,933
But that was a long-distance relationship.

1045
00:43:32,900 --> 00:43:34,133
I asked you why you didn't often go out

1046
00:43:34,133 --> 00:43:34,966
for a casual drink with friends.

1047
00:43:35,000 --> 00:43:37,133
You said you were
in a long-distance relationship.

1048
00:43:37,133 --> 00:43:38,366
Since drinking occasions

1049
00:43:38,400 --> 00:43:39,500
inevitably involved other girls,

1050
00:43:39,500 --> 00:43:40,500
you simply skipped it.

1051
00:43:42,133 --> 00:43:43,066
In that moment,

1052
00:43:43,100 --> 00:43:44,966
my feelings were incredibly complex.

1053
00:43:45,000 --> 00:43:46,866
I was moved and also struck
by some unpleasant memories.

1054
00:43:46,866 --> 00:43:48,666
There was even a hint of jealousy.

1055
00:43:50,400 --> 00:43:51,500
In my past relationships,

1056
00:43:51,500 --> 00:43:54,366
I was always told
to be tolerant and understanding,

1057
00:43:54,400 --> 00:43:54,933
not to be difficult.

1058
00:43:54,933 --> 00:43:56,533
My bottom line in relationships

1059
00:43:56,533 --> 00:43:58,600
was unknowingly lowered.

1060
00:43:59,233 --> 00:43:59,933
But in that moment,

1061
00:43:59,933 --> 00:44:00,800
I saw in your eyes

1062
00:44:00,833 --> 00:44:02,500
the self that had been hidden away.

1063
00:44:03,200 --> 00:44:04,833
I saw that little girl
who once believed in love

1064
00:44:04,833 --> 00:44:07,100
and was full of hope for relationships.

1065
00:44:07,100 --> 00:44:09,166
My heart was already a bird
in the wilderness,

1066
00:44:09,200 --> 00:44:10,833
but in that moment, circling around,

1067
00:44:10,833 --> 00:44:13,166
it flew back to a once-familiar sky.

1068
00:44:15,500 --> 00:44:16,333
Thank you, Tao (Guo Zhentao).

1069
00:44:16,333 --> 00:44:17,733
Today is the last day on the island.

1070
00:44:17,733 --> 00:44:19,766
Let's say a proper goodbye here.

1071
00:44:19,800 --> 00:44:21,200
A proper goodbye.

1072
00:44:22,900 --> 00:44:23,833
Okay.

1073
00:44:26,300 --> 00:44:28,300
Goodbye, the reserved Tao (Guo Zhentao)
on the island.

1074
00:44:28,300 --> 00:44:30,100
Goodbye, the seemingly carefree

1075
00:44:30,100 --> 00:44:31,366
but inwardly a bit fragile

1076
00:44:31,400 --> 00:44:32,500
Autumn (Qiu Tong) on the island.

1077
00:44:33,033 --> 00:44:34,566
Goodbye, these special memories.

1078
00:44:34,600 --> 00:44:36,100
Once we leave the island,
we'll go our separate ways.

1079
00:44:36,100 --> 00:44:36,633
Reading this,

1080
00:44:36,666 --> 00:44:38,500
have you already shed
some crocodile tears?

1081
00:44:40,533 --> 00:44:41,366
It was nice meeting you.

1082
00:44:41,400 --> 00:44:42,000
I'm Qiu Tong.

1083
00:44:42,000 --> 00:44:43,100
I hope after we leave the island,

1084
00:44:43,100 --> 00:44:44,500
we'll have time to share
a meal again sometime.

1085
00:44:45,700 --> 00:44:47,566
Did you catch the joking tone
in the last part?

1086
00:44:49,266 --> 00:44:50,400
I didn't.

1087
00:44:50,433 --> 00:44:51,500
I almost cried.

1088
00:44:52,633 --> 00:44:53,966
Almost cried?

1089
00:44:54,000 --> 00:44:54,666
And?

1090
00:44:54,666 --> 00:44:56,300
Seeing "share a meal" made me happy again.

1091
00:44:57,333 --> 00:44:58,066
Not bad.

1092
00:44:58,100 --> 00:44:58,766
Really?

1093
00:44:59,500 --> 00:45:00,500
Keep in touch.

1094
00:45:00,833 --> 00:45:03,166
[Keep in Touch]

1095
00:45:06,833 --> 00:45:08,500
I have good feelings about her.

1096
00:45:08,500 --> 00:45:11,366
I'd like to keep seeing her

1097
00:45:11,400 --> 00:45:13,600
after we leave the island.

1098
00:45:14,866 --> 00:45:16,900
Tao (Guo Zhentao) also gave me
some new surprises

1099
00:45:16,900 --> 00:45:19,633
when it comes to love.

1100
00:45:19,666 --> 00:45:20,700
Because for me,

1101
00:45:20,700 --> 00:45:24,566
my expectations for love
might have been worn down.

1102
00:45:25,000 --> 00:45:27,800
In this not-too-long time
we've spent together,

1103
00:45:27,800 --> 00:45:32,033
we actually haven't had
many chances for deep talks.

1104
00:45:33,800 --> 00:45:36,733
So we'll just have to chat more
after the show ends.

1105
00:45:48,866 --> 00:45:50,766
[When we meet again, let roasting
and meals become our regular thing.]

1106
00:45:50,800 --> 00:45:52,466
Let me see your handwriting.

1107
00:45:53,933 --> 00:45:54,766
No cap,

1108
00:45:54,800 --> 00:45:56,433
it's actually pretty good.

1109
00:45:57,466 --> 00:45:59,200
Does my handwriting look like a kid's?

1110
00:45:59,233 --> 00:46:00,133
It's kinda cute.

1111
00:46:00,133 --> 00:46:01,400
